# 📚 TOEIC Vocabulary - Day30

| Word | Meaning | Example |
|---|---|---|
| efficient | 효율적인 | The new system is more efficient. |
| productive | 생산적인 | The meeting was very productive. |
| implement | 시행하다, 실행하다 | The company implemented a new policy. |
| reduce | 줄이다 | The new system reduced costs. |
| improve | 개선하다 | We need to improve customer service. |

